meta {
  name: Communities - Newest posts
  type: http
  seq: 154
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/newest-posts
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The 10 newest posts of the public discussion spaces of a community, for its public page (#1485): cuid, title, slug, excerpt, author (name, username, avatar), space and date. Never a deleted post, a post of a space that is not public, or one of a chat space.
  Public: works without a session and without a token when the community has a public space that is not a chat space (404 for a visitor and 403 for a signed-in person who is not a member otherwise). Needs the posts:read ability with a token. Limited per IP address for visitors.
}
